    DXVAV Sys 1 Return Fan Outlet,  !- Component 1 Outlet Node Name
    AirLoopHVAC:OutdoorAirSystem,  !- Component 2 Object Type
    DXVAV Sys 1 OA System,   !- Component 2 Name
    DXVAV Sys 1 Return Fan Outlet,  !- Component 2 Inlet Node Name
    DXVAV Sys 1 Mixed Air Outlet,  !- Component 2 Outlet Node Name
    CoilSystem:Cooling:DX,   !- Component 3 Object Type
    DXVAV Sys 1 System,      !- Component 3 Name
    DXVAV Sys 1 Mixed Air Outlet,  !- Component 3 Inlet Node Name
    DXVAV Sys 1 Cooling Coil Outlet,  !- Component 3 Outlet Node Name
    Coil:Heating:Electric,   !- Component 4 Object Type
    DXVAV Sys 1 Heating Coil,!- Component 4 Name
    DXVAV Sys 1 Cooling Coil Outlet,  !- Component 4 Inlet Node Name
    DXVAV Sys 1 Heating Coil Outlet,  !- Component 4 Outlet Node Name
    Fan:VariableVolume,      !- Component 5 Object Type
