    0.476428,                !- Coefficient1 Constant
    0.401147E-01,            !- Coefficient2 x
    0.226411E-03,            !- Coefficient3 x**2
    -0.827136E-03,           !- Coefficient4 y
    -0.732240E-05,           !- Coefficient5 y**2
