    -0.343731E-01,           !- Coefficient2 x
    0.783173E-03,            !- Coefficient3 x**2
    0.146596E-01,            !- Coefficient4 y
    0.488851E-03,            !- Coefficient5 y**2
    -0.752036E-03,           !- Coefficient6 x*y
    12.77778,                !- Minimum Value of x
